  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your dragonbane aura protects against the breath weapon of your hated foe.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Dragonbane Aura<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As a move action, you can enhance your aura of courage to grant affected creatures resistance equal to five times your mythic tier to a single type of energy until the beginning of your next turn. This resistance is halved against effects other than the exceptional and supernatural abilities of dragons (including creatures using the dragon breath or form of the dragon spells). You may spend one use of mythic power as a swift action to either double this resistance or extend its duration to 1 minute, or both if you expend two uses of mythic power.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc111\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
